&nbsp;

<span style="font-weight: 400;">O custo das fotos de passaporte em Portugal geralmente varia de €5 a €15 para um conjunto de várias (geralmente 6-8) fotos impressas que atendam aos requisitos oficiais. É uma boa ideia verificar com estúdios de fotografia locais, cabines de fotos ou farmácias para preços específicos em sua área.</span>

<span style="font-weight: 400;">Com o Smartphone ID, você pode obter sua foto de passaporte de forma barata, rápida, verificada e aprovada.</span>

&nbsp;

<aside class="kal-accordion-item-active-aside">Yes! You can take your own passport photo. You can do it with the back camera of your phone, but make sure that you are following all the guidelines to have your photo accepted (lighting, shadow, background color). You can also use the Smartphone iD tool that does everything for you. Simply choose your country and document, take a photo, and receive it later in email. It’s that easy!

</aside>

&nbsp;

<span style="font-weight: 400;">In België kunnen de kosten van pasfoto's variëren afhankelijk van waar je naartoe gaat. Meestal betaal je ongeveer €10 tot €15 voor een set van vier foto's. Het is een goed idee om contact op te nemen met lokale fotografen, fotocabines of apotheken voor specifieke prijzen in jouw regio.</span>

<span style="font-weight: 400;">Bij Smartphone ID kun je goedkoop, snel, gecontroleerd en goedgekeurd je pasfoto krijgen.</span>

&nbsp;

<aside class="kal-accordion-item-active-aside">Yes! You can take your own passport photo. You can do it with the back camera of your phone, but make sure that you are following all the guidelines to have your photo accepted (lighting, shadow, background color). You can also use the Smartphone iD tool that does everything for you. Simply choose your country and document, take a photo, and receive it later in email. It’s that easy!

